WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.731 line:84%
Namaste means hello. For morning say suprabhat, and for night say shubh ratri.

00:00:07.731 --> 00:00:14.262 line:84%
Aap kaise hain? How are you? Main theek hoon. I am fine. To thank someone, say dhanyavaad.

00:00:15.262 --> 00:00:20.422 line:84%
To say your name, say: mera naam, then your name, then hai.
